  "job_B3.5.8_20251003_114757": {
    "chunk_text": "Wala \u00feam \u00fee on \u00feystrum wunigan sceal, on swa langum sea\u00f0e & on swa \u00feystrum stowum & on swa Eala, man \u00fee \u00feis gehyrst \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00f0e secge, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee f\u00e6der ne gehelp\u00f0 his suna, ne him to Ne \u00fe\u00e6r naht elles nis gehyred butan wanung & granung & grisbitung of to\u00fee. Hw\u00e6t, \u00fear m\u00e6nig earm man sec\u00f0 georne, & him wisce\u00f0 dea\u00fees ende, & hi hw\u00e6\u00f0ere \u00fear n\u00e6fre sweltan \u00dear eac swilce beo\u00f0 \u00fea earman mid \u00feam earmum \u00e6fre gemengede, & \u00fea oferhydigan mid \u00feam \u00dear beo\u00f0 \u00fea gitseras mid \u00feam unrihtnimendum \u00feeofum, & \u00fear beo\u00f0 eac gewislice \u00fea unrihtwise So\u00f0lice \u00feis halig gewrit cwy\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ealle \u00feas fordonan & heora gelican on mycelre unare beo\u00f0 \u00fear Swa \u00f0e eadiga Augustinus \u00feur God be \u00feam s\u00e6de \u00fee \u00feis godspel dihte & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Dominicae Nabba\u00f0 \u00fea sawla witodlice nane o\u00f0re reste \u00fee on witum beo\u00f0 butan on \u00feam drihtenlican \u00e6riste. On \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fee drihten of dea\u00fee aras, \u00feonne mot anra gehwylces mannes sawl, ge so\u00f0f\u00e6stes mannes Uton nu \u00fei gehyran hw\u00e6t \u00f0e gode gast spec\u00f0 to \u00feam lichaman \u00feonne he him \u00e6rest to cym\u00f0. \u00deonne gret he hine \u00feus \u00feysum wordum, Bene ualeas bene sis qui bonum uas electio mihi fuisti, amice Eall swa ic wolde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu w\u00e6re godes donde.",
